diff --git a//tmp/set-2-437-440-prompts.txt b//tmp/set-2-437-440-prompts.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..ee3789700e9f169dfbb82d1da4d7fc8c8a7ed7eb
--- /dev/null
+++ b//tmp/set-2-437-440-prompts.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+437-deep-dream.png
+
+Generate one fresh image from text only, with no reference images. Square 1024x1024. Use case: stylized-concept. Style is the primary subject: an authentic 2015 DeepDream neural-network hallucination, recursively amplified image features, fractal dog snouts, dog faces and dozens of eyes emerging everywhere from hair curls, sweater knit stitches, ceramic cup and curling vapor, nested self-similar paisley swirls and psychedelic organic architectures. Fully commit to peculiar early convolutional-neural-network dream aesthetics: dense crunchy hyper-patterned textures, iridescent acid teal, electric blue, coral, gold and violet, repeated canine eyes at multiple scales, surreal stretched anatomy and impossible surfaces. At the center of this impossible dream is a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater, enjoying coffee with a croissant nearby. Composition: a very close, tilted three-quarter view, her face sweeping diagonally into tangled curls, hands cradling the cup near her chin, a crescent croissant in the near lower edge dissolving into the hallucinatory cafe. Character remains recognizable within the neural hallucination. The recursive dream patterns must transform every surface, not merely decorate a normal photographic portrait. Style determines anatomy, framing, perspective, light and palette. No text, captions, lettering, signatures or watermarks.
+
+---
+
+438-spectrogram.png
+
+Generate one fresh image from text only, with no reference images. Square 1024x1024. Use case: stylized-concept. Create an authentic-looking audio spectrogram visualization in scientific software whose frequency heatmap itself forms the subject, entirely made of fine time-frequency intensity bins, broken horizontal harmonic bands, vertical transients and granular spectral noise. Pure flat screen capture of a scientific plotting canvas, no monitor, no photographic image. Magma colormap only: almost-black and deep purple background, magenta-to-orange mid energy, yellow and ivory maximum intensity. A large central rectangular plot with thin neutral axes, unlabeled tick marks and subtle graticule; small unlabelled vertical color scale at the side. The spectrogram forms a clear left-facing side-profile bust of a woman early 30s, curly shoulder-length hair whose auburn identity is translated into glowing orange-magenta harmonic curls, freckles as small hot frequency clusters, round tortoiseshell glasses as spectral loops, mustard-yellow knit sweater as gold-orange low-frequency bands. She is happily sipping from a coffee cup held near her lips; a croissant-shaped cluster rests near the lower right of the plotting field. Let spectral horizontal streaks and vertical bin structure break apart all contours so the portrait is encoded in signal energy, rather than a drawn portrait sitting on top of a chart. Broad areas of empty near-black signal field around the profile, precise scientific-software look. Absolutely no readable text, numbers, letters, axis labels, captions, signatures or watermarks.
+
+---
+
+439-emoji-mosaic.png
+
+Generate one fresh image from text only, with no reference images. Square 1024x1024. Use case: stylized-concept. A meticulous photomosaic portrait BUILT ENTIRELY from thousands of tiny individual colorful emoji icons, roughly 80 to 100 icons across the square. At first glance the aggregate icon colors form a bright closely cropped front-facing smiling woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater; she enjoys a coffee, holding the cup prominently just below her smiling mouth, with a croissant nearby in the bottom corner. At closer inspection every part of her face, hair, glasses, cup, pastry, sweater and background is made only of miniature distinct emoji pictograms on a tight regular mosaic grid. Emoji vocabulary: little smiling faces, hearts, tiny animals, flowers, fruit, coffee cups, crescent croissants, suns, leaves, stars and other familiar rounded colorful emoji illustrations, with no typographic glyphs or numbers. Use warm brown-orange icons in her curls and tortoiseshell rims, peach and cream icons for skin, mustard and gold icons for sweater, darker icons for freckles. Keep the underlying mosaic tiled and crisp across the whole surface, all tiny icons visible as icons on close inspection. Do not overlay icons on a continuous photograph and do not hide an ordinary smooth portrait beneath the tiles. The entire tonal likeness must emerge from the icon choices and spacing. Flat, clean digital mosaic medium, tightly cropped frontal framing, playful multicolored cream-based background. No text, captions, signatures or watermarks.
+
+---
+
+440-spreadsheet-art.png
+
+Generate one fresh image from text only, with no reference images. Square 1024x1024. Use case: stylized-concept. Authentic spreadsheet cell art, seen as a flat straight-on screenshot of an open spreadsheet document. The artwork is created solely by changing background fill colors of many tiny perfectly square spreadsheet cells, about 80 cells across and down; crisp thin visible gray gridlines divide every cell. It is deliberately blocky low-resolution pixel art, with no smooth photographic contours or painted shading across cells. A wide scene: a small full-body seated woman at a cafe table, legs and chair visible, ample pale uncolored worksheet around her. She is in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair represented by a chunky rust pixel silhouette, freckles represented by individual darker peach cells, round tortoiseshell glasses rendered as small dark pixel rings, a mustard-yellow knit sweater represented by gold and ochre cell patterns. She leans back contentedly while raising a coffee cup in one hand; a recognizable blocky golden croissant sits on a saucer on the little table beside her. Spreadsheet medium dictates all proportions: charming simplified squat pixel anatomy, stepped edges, limited flat fill-color palette, no gradients, no raster photo pasted into cells. Muted off-white, gray, mustard, burnt orange and a little dusty teal. Show a thin gray row-header strip at left and column-header strip at top, with empty header cells and a blank corner selector, tiny blank UI controls and scrollbars. The headers must have no readable text or numbers, just empty cells. Absolutely no text, captions, letters, numbers, signatures or watermarks.
+

